# Environment files. Commit .env.example only.
#
# Note that every VITE_* variable is inlined into the production bundle by Vite,
# so nothing secret can ever live here - a Stripe *publishable* key is fine, a
# secret key is not. Ignoring .env keeps a future mistake out of the repository.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

